{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iPhone 用久之後，喇叭網罩容易積聚灰塵與細小碎屑，音量或會變得沙啞。Dust Cleaner 透過低頻聲音與震動，協助把鬆散的灰塵、碎屑及水珠從喇叭網罩帶走。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合經常在戶外或潮濕環境使用手機的用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-37.webp\">\n<h2>多種模式配合震動清理</h2>\n<p>開啟引導模式並把音量調高，將喇叭朝下持機，App 會播放低頻音調，支援裝置同時發出觸覺反饋。內置 Water Eject、Speaker Dust、Gentle Mode 與可手動設定頻率及時間的 Advanced 模式，畫面顯示進度與剩餘時間。它只針對鬆散微粒與水珠，不能修理損壞喇叭或清理已壓實塵垢，事後宜用柔軟乾刷。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-37.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-38.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-39.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-40.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-41.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-42.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iPhoneDustCleaner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:04:58.669837+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:50:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:38:40.148112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:58:08.505437+00:00","content_hash":"800d74baa547156d2ff32bb3a57c81cdd92386d8208bcc68cf189d0540554ae6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}